

Prògram stiùireadh-cuimhne: 1.

>> x := 0.
>> y := ['Hello'].
>> q := { ['']. }.
>> p := Fìor.
>> a := Liosta ← 1 ; 2 ; 3 ; 4.
>> c := Oibseact ùr.
c air: ['greet:'] dèan: { Às-chur sgrìobh: ['greet!']. }.

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.
>> usedMemory5 := 0.

Prògram sgioblaich.
>> usedMemory1 := (Prògram cuimhne ? 0).




